        "faq_question_jWPMhp": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Constipation works overnight to relieve occasional constipation by stimulating the digestive system. </p><p>Within 2-3 weeks, get regular as our clinically-studied ingredients support the body's natural detoxification process and promotes gut motility.</p>",
            "title": "How quickly does Constipation work?"
          },
          "type": "faq-question"
        },
        "faq_question_kXCcU3": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Take 2-3 Constipation Alchemy Capsules with a full glass of water daily at bedtime to become a regular, or as needed to relieve occasional constipation</p>",
            "title": "How do I take Constipation?"
          },
          "type": "faq-question"
        },
        "faq_question_ww97eB": {
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Harsh stimulant laxatives cause unwanted side effects and emergency bathroom runs.</p><p>In contrast, our capsules contain a gentle saline laxative, Magnesium Citrate.</p><p>This ingredient pulls water into the intestines to soften the stool, making it easier to pass.</p>",
            "title": "Does Constipation contain any harsh laxatives?"
